Z||000000||Elenor84||09-05-2001||02:08 AM||||Alright guys....I'm doing this exact swap.  I know I know and I did search the archives but nothing.  There's so many little questions I have that aren't in any books.  Wiring harness to the dash.  Relocating fuel lines.  Stuff like this.  If you wouldn't mind emailing me stuff on how exactly u did your swap I would love u forever!<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||5
